From 0a3478caa88dccec295fb3dbfb00a47b38cc562f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NEXUS <nexus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:28:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/22] NEXUS engine: keep the yuzu Emulator Project copyright
 notices

Lichii #1544 (9b50adb7b) removed the 'SPDX-FileCopyrightText: ... yuzu Emulator Project' lines
from 2,512 source files. The code is still the yuzu project's work under GPL-3.0, whose notices
must be kept, so the NEXUS engine restores them (a revert of that commit).

(cherry picked from commit 405b988756161e29f4422b24a78ea71f26674556)
